---
title: "initializePublishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: Legion operator initializes result publication
    q_check_caller --> q_check_timing: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_timing --> q_check_not_locked: block.timestamp >= refundEndTime
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: refund period not ended
    q_check_not_locked --> q_lock: cancelLocked == false
    q_check_not_locked --> q_revert_locked: already locked
    q_lock --> [*]: cancelLocked = true, emit CancellationLocked()
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotEnded
    q_revert_locked --> [*]: revert AlreadyLocked

    note right of q_lock
        INV-001: Once cancelLocked == true, project admin cannot cancel the sale
        INV-002: This is a one-way state transition (irreversible)
        INV-003: Must occur before publishSaleResults can be called
    end note
